{"id":"ff4636701b68a3a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-cat2-coend.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Coend","display":"df-zfc-cat2-coend — ZFC Cat2 Coend","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-coend","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-coend"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-coend — ZFC Cat2 Coend","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-coend"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-coend</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-coend — ZFC Cat2 Coend"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r\\in V\">\\(E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r\\in V\\)</span> (coend object, functor, two categories, a supplied product-category code, and its diagonal/off-diagonal maps)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_D,t_D,c_D,e_D\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle P_0,P_1,s_P,t_P,c_P,e_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle P_0,P_1,s_P,t_P,c_P,e_P\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2Coend}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2Coend}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 是断言中展开的六元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的对象、箭头与复合使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的明确集合编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span> (explicit category-structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductCategory}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal P=\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\{\\langle c,\\langle c,c\\rangle\\rangle:c\\in C_0\\}\n\\land q=\\{\\langle f,\\langle t_C(f),s_C(f)\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell=\\{\\langle f,\\langle e_C(t_C(f)),f\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}\n\\land r=\\{\\langle f,\\langle f,e_C(s_C(f))\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal P=\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\{\\langle c,\\langle c,c\\rangle\\rangle:c\\in C_0\\}\n\\land q=\\{\\langle f,\\langle t_C(f),s_C(f)\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell=\\{\\langle f,\\langle e_C(t_C(f)),f\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}\n\\land r=\\{\\langle f,\\langle f,e_C(s_C(f))\\rangle\\rangle:f\\in C_1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}coend} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2Coend}_S(E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal P)\\land\n\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,C_0,P_0)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,C_1,P_0)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,C_1,P_1)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,C_1,P_1)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;s_P(\\ell(f))=q(f)\\land t_P(\\ell(f))=d(t_C(f))\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_P(r(f))=q(f)\\land t_P(r(f))=d(s_C(f))\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\land E\\in D_0\\land\n\\exists\\iota\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,C_0,D_1)\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\\bigl(s_D(\\iota(c))=F_0(d(c))\\land t_D(\\iota(c))=E\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(c_D(\\langle\\iota(t_C(f)),F_1(\\ell(f))\\rangle)=c_D(\\langle\\iota(s_C(f)),F_1(r(f))\\rangle)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall X\\in D_0\\;\\forall\\xi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\xi,C_0,D_1)\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\\bigl(s_D(\\xi(c))=F_0(d(c))\\land t_D(\\xi(c))=X\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(c_D(\\langle\\xi(t_C(f)),F_1(\\ell(f))\\rangle)=c_D(\\langle\\xi(s_C(f)),F_1(r(f))\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists!u\\in D_1\\;\\bigl(s_D(u)=E\\land t_D(u)=X\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;(\\xi(c)=c_D(\\langle u,\\iota(c)\\rangle))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}coend} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2Coend}_S(E,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal P)\\land\n\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal P,d,q,\\ell,r,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,C_0,P_0)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,C_1,P_0)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,C_1,P_1)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,C_1,P_1)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;s_P(\\ell(f))=q(f)\\land t_P(\\ell(f))=d(t_C(f))\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_P(r(f))=q(f)\\land t_P(r(f))=d(s_C(f))\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\land E\\in D_0\\land\n\\exists\\iota\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,C_0,D_1)\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\\bigl(s_D(\\iota(c))=F_0(d(c))\\land t_D(\\iota(c))=E\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(c_D(\\langle\\iota(t_C(f)),F_1(\\ell(f))\\rangle)=c_D(\\langle\\iota(s_C(f)),F_1(r(f))\\rangle)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall X\\in D_0\\;\\forall\\xi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\xi,C_0,D_1)\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;\\bigl(s_D(\\xi(c))=F_0(d(c))\\land t_D(\\xi(c))=X\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(c_D(\\langle\\xi(t_C(f)),F_1(\\ell(f))\\rangle)=c_D(\\langle\\xi(s_C(f)),F_1(r(f))\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists!u\\in D_1\\;\\bigl(s_D(u)=E\\land t_D(u)=X\\land\n\\forall c\\in C_0\\;(\\xi(c)=c_D(\\langle u,\\iota(c)\\rangle))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,q,\\ell,r\">\\(d,q,\\ell,r\\)</span> 显式提供 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\)</span> 中对角对象及两条典范箭头的数据；对象、箭头、源靶、复合和函子分量均不再由隐藏操作符提供。</li>\n<li>反范畴、范畴积和两条典范箭头均已给出函数图，不再允许仅满足源靶等式的任意范畴充当该积。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 是断言中展开的六元谓词；$\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C$ 的对象、箭头与复合使用 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的明确集合编码。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-ca